    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d946">

                <pb facs="0959" n="871" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg871"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bowen to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Caracas,
                                Venezuela</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-03-02"><hi rendition="#italic">March 2,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to send to you herewith,
                    two copies of President Castro’s message and two copies of the report of the
                    minister for foreign affairs<anchor n="a" xml:id="d946-f1"/> to the Venezuelan
                    Congress.</p>
                <p>On <ref target="#pg32">page 32</ref> of the message you will find an eloquent
                    expression of gratitude to President Roosevelt and the American people. * *
                    *</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herbert W. Bowen.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d946-a1.xml" xpointer="d946-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
